### Scene State Data Flow

```
Webcam frame (640×480 BGR)
    ↓ flip (mirror)
    ↓ BGR→RGB
    ↓ MediaPipe detect_for_video()
    ↓ 21 3D landmarks (x,y,z ∈ [0,1])
    ↓ _smooth_landmarks() [EMA α=0.7]
    ↓ _normalize_landmarks() [wrist=origin, ÷palm_size]
    ↓ _extract_features() [pinch=1-dist(4,8), curl=1-|tip|, EMA]
    ↓ _compute_and_store_pose() [5-point palm center, deltas, direction]
    ↓ _apply_gesture_to_scene() [confidence+EMA+deadzone filters]
    ↓
SceneState.rotation_y += dx * 200  (PINCH gesture)
SceneState.scale = clamp(scale + dy*3, 0.5, 3.0)  (OPEN HAND)
SceneState.frozen = True  (FIST gesture)
    ↓ (read by renderer 30x/second)
SimpleRenderer._draw_frame(rotation_y, scale, frozen, gesture)
    ↓
OpenCV window: "HoloScript Renderer" — 800×600 canvas with rotating square
```

